"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1007033697,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDA3MDMzNjk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/salvageable","name":"salvageable","color":"ff7766","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-07-28T04:19:51Z","updated_at":"2025-10-10T16:19:33Z","closed_at":"2025-10-09T12:20:01Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109040","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109040","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109040.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109040.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Whether the engine is built with physics and navigation modules affects the `Performance` class. However, there are errors and inconsistencies.\r\n\r\n|   | Disable Physics 2D | Disable Physics 3D | Disable Navigation 2D / 3D |\r\n|---| --- | --- | --- |\r\n| `get_monitor_name()` | Correct | Correct | Wrong[^1] |\r\n| `get_monitor_type()` | Correct | Correct | Wrong[^1] |\r\n| Enums for scripting | Available | Removed[^2] | Removed |\r\n\r\nIn this PR:\r\n\r\n- Always remove the relevant enum values, both in C++ and script bindings.\r\n- Fixes index mismatches.\r\n- The current check `static_assert(std::size(types) == MONITOR_MAX)` is bound to succeed because the array is defined with `MONITOR_MAX`. This PR removes the explicit size, relying on `static_assert` to ensure that mismatched sizes cannot pass compilation.\r\n\r\n[^1]: Related monitors are skipped when building the result array, so index mismatches.\r\n[^2]: By checking the wrong macro.","closed_by":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109040/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109040/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}